# Local data — never commit real patient FCS files.
# The one exception is packages/fcs/test/fixtures/, which is reserved for a real,
# publicly-licensed FCS file (RESEARCH.md V-3). Read that directory's README before
# adding anything to it: the parser suite is deliberately fixture-free today.
*.fcs
!packages/fcs/test/fixtures/*.fcs
